        m_Value: Show
    - rid: 552786288315990085
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724797997531139
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Selects what it's about, and frames it in the view
    - rid: 552786288315990086
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724797997531140
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Every error (marked in red) and warning (marked in yellow)
    - rid: 552786288315990087
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724797997531141
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Those with a Fix button, which fixes them for you
    - rid: 552786288315990088
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2724798001725440
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Those you fix yourself, as each says how
    - rid: 552786288315990120
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2758288646750208
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Find In Directory
    - rid: 552786288315990121
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2758288650944512
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Choose a folder to search for the first Maps, Shapes, Physics and Sounds files, and the Plugins and Scripts folders (Aleph One only), looking through shallower subfolders before deeper ones. Files are recognized by their extensions, or (for files without one) by their contents; folders by their names. Any type that isn't found is unloaded.
    - rid: 552786288315990122
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2758288650944513
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Choose a folder to find files in
    - rid: 552786377617702964
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4202966390816768
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Orthographic Grid Opacity
    - rid: 552786377617702965
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4202966395011072
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How see-through the grid drawn under the level in the Orthographic view is (one square per world unit). At 0%, it isn't drawn.
