        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: the scenario''s Plugins folder. The MML of each plugin that''s on (in the dropdown below) changes the textures, sprites and sounds levels are shown with, as it does in Aleph One, after the Scripts folder''s MML does.'
    - rid: 552786384866508851
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4257400206540801
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Scripts (Aleph One only)
    - rid: 552786384866508852
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4257400206540802
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: the scenario''s Scripts folder. Its MML files (in name order) change the textures, sprites and sounds levels are shown with, as they do in Aleph One.'
    - rid: 552786384866508853
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4257400206540803
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: select a folder...
    - rid: 552786384866508854
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4257400206540804
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Plugins: {0} of {1} on'
    - rid: 552786384866508855
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4257400210735104
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: No plugins
    - rid: 552786384866508856
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4257400210735105
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Aleph One only: turn each of the scenario''s plugins on or off, as in Aleph One''s Plugins menu. An open level is shown again with the change (keeping its edits).'
    - rid: 552786384866508857
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4257400210735106
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0} (not in use)'
    - rid: 552786384866508858
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4257400210735107
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Version {0}
    - rid: 552786384866508859
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4257400210735108
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Not for this scenario, so it isn't used.
    - rid: 552786384866508860
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4257400210735109
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Not in use: another plugin''s HUD, stats, theme or Lua takes its place (as in Aleph One, the last such plugin that''s on is used).'
    - rid: 552786384866508861
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4257400210735110
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: It has no MML or shapes patches, so it doesn't change what ForgePlus shows.
    - rid: 552786384866508862
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4257400210735111
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Choose {0} folder
    - rid: 552786384866508865
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4283477264056320
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Surface Cache Global Illumination
    - rid: 552786384866508866
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4283477268250624
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Bounced (indirect) light from the level's lit surfaces onto others, calculated as you view the level. It's costly, and isn't how Marathon or Aleph One light levels, so it's off unless turned on here.
    - rid: 552786384866508900
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4283477268250625
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Point Snapping Distance
    - rid: 552786384866508901
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4283477268250626
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0} px'
    - rid: 552786384866508902
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4283477268250627
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How near (in pixels on screen) a line drawn from a point (with Geometry mode's Draw tool) has to come to another point to end there.
    - rid: 552786384866508910
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4283477268250628
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Reset To Defaults
    - rid: 552786384866508911
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 4283477268250629
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Sets every setting kept between sessions back to how it starts: those in this tab, the display options (such as Clip Platform Sides and the sound displays), and Save Merged''s remembered choice, and turns each plugin back on or off as it starts. The files'' paths are kept, as are the options that only last for the session (such as the visualization options).'
    - rid: 552786424166088762
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888703377408
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Reset All Inputs
    - rid: 552786424166088763
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766016
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Puts every input back to its default keys and buttons.
    - rid: 552786424166088764
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766017
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Reset
    - rid: 552786424166088765
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766018
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Puts this input back to its default keys and buttons.
    - rid: 552786424166088766
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766019
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Click, then press a key or mouse button to bind it here. Escape cancels.
    - rid: 552786424166088767
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766020
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Press a key or mouse button to bind.

          Escape cancels.'
    - rid: 552786424166088768
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766021
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Camera
    - rid: 552786424166088769
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766022
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Selection
    - rid: 552786424166088770
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766023
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Moving & Snapping
    - rid: 552786424166088771
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766024
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Textures
    - rid: 552786424166088772
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766025
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Platforms
    - rid: 552786424166088773
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766026
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Interface
    - rid: 552786424166088774
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766027
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Move Forward
    - rid: 552786424166088775
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766028
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Moves the camera forward while held. In the top-down view, it moves up across the view.
    - rid: 552786424166088776
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766029
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Move Back
    - rid: 552786424166088777
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766030
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Moves the camera back while held. In the top-down view, it moves down across the view.
    - rid: 552786424166088778
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766031
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Move Left
    - rid: 552786424166088779
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766032
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Moves the camera left while held.
    - rid: 552786424166088780
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766033
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Move Right
    - rid: 552786424166088781
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766034
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Moves the camera right while held.
    - rid: 552786424166088782
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766035
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Move Up
    - rid: 552786424166088783
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766036
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Raises the camera while held. In the top-down view, what's above the camera isn't drawn.
    - rid: 552786424166088784
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766037
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Move Down
    - rid: 552786424166088785
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766038
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Lowers the camera while held. In the top-down view, what's above the camera isn't drawn.
    - rid: 552786424166088786
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766039
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Move Faster
    - rid: 552786424166088787
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766040
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Hold to move the camera faster.
    - rid: 552786424166088788
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766041
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Look Around
    - rid: 552786424166088789
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766042
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Hold and move the mouse to turn the camera. Looking around is locked in the top-down view.
    - rid: 552786424166088790
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766043
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Pan
    - rid: 552786424166088791
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766044
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Hold and drag to grab the level and slide across it. What you grabbed stays under the pointer.
    - rid: 552786424166088792
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766045
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Pan with Select
    - rid: 552786424166088793
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766046
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Hold, then drag with Select, to pan as Pan does (rather than selecting or dragging what's under the pointer).
    - rid: 552786424166088794
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766047
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Frame Selection
    - rid: 552786424166088795
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766048
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Moves the camera to show the selection. With nothing selected, it frames what was last selected, or the nearest object.
    - rid: 552786424166088796
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766049
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Toggle Top-Down View
    - rid: 552786424166088797
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766050
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Switches between the perspective view and the top-down (orthographic) view. Not while Ctrl or Command is held.
    - rid: 552786424166088798
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766051
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Select
    - rid: 552786424166088799
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766052
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Click to select what's under the pointer, and drag to move or adjust it (or, from empty space, to select by rectangle). In Geometry mode's Draw tool, drag from a line or point to draw (or click empty space, then press again and drag), double-click a line to add a point on it, and double-click a cyan floor to fill its loop of lines with a polygon.
    - rid: 552786424166088800
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766053
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Add to Selection
    - rid: 552786424166088801
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766054
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Hold while clicking, or while selecting by rectangle, to add to the selection (or click to take something out of it) rather than replacing it.
    - rid: 552786424166088802
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766055
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Select Touching
    - rid: 552786424166088803
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766056
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Hold while selecting by rectangle to select what the rectangle touches any part of, rather than only what's wholly in it.
    - rid: 552786424166088804
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766057
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Cancel Selection Box
    - rid: 552786424166088805
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766058
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: While selecting by rectangle, stops it and puts the selection back as it was. (A key it shares with Toggle Menu only cancels, then.)
    - rid: 552786424166088806
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766059
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Lock X Axis
    - rid: 552786424166088807
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766060
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Toggles a lock that keeps dragged points, polygons and objects from moving along X (locking one axis unlocks the other). Not while Ctrl or Command is held.
    - rid: 552786424166088808
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766061
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Lock Y Axis
    - rid: 552786424166088809
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766062
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Toggles a lock that keeps dragged points, polygons and objects from moving along Y (locking one axis unlocks the other). Not while Ctrl or Command is held.
    - rid: 552786424166088810
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766063
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Invert Snapping
    - rid: 552786424166088811
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766064
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Hold while dragging or nudging to snap when Snapping is off, or not snap when it's on.
    - rid: 552786424166088812
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766065
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Keep Height Above Floor
    - rid: 552786424166088813
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766066
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Hold while dragging an object into another polygon to keep its distance from that polygon's floor (or ceiling, for From Ceiling), rather than its height in the world.
    - rid: 552786424166088814
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766067
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Move Textures Along
    - rid: 552786424166088815
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766068
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Hold while dragging points, lines or polygons to move the textures around them with them (and the matching textures that continue them), rather than leaving them where they were. It can be pressed or let go mid-drag.
    - rid: 552786424166088816
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766069
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Allow Invalid Geometry
    - rid: 552786424166088817
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766070
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Hold while dragging or drawing to let geometry go where it would make a polygon invalid (shown in red), which is otherwise prevented.
    - rid: 552786424166088818
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766071
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Nudge Texture Up
    - rid: 552786424166088819
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766072
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Textures mode, moves the selected surface's texture up by a classic pixel (a 128th of a world unit), or, with Snapping, to the next 32nd of a world unit. A transparent texture layered over a wall isn't nudged (adjust it in the inspector).
    - rid: 552786424166088820
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766073
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Nudge Texture Down
    - rid: 552786424166088821
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766074
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Textures mode, moves the selected surface's texture down by a classic pixel (a 128th of a world unit), or, with Snapping, to the next 32nd of a world unit. A transparent texture layered over a wall isn't nudged (adjust it in the inspector).
    - rid: 552786424166088822
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766075
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Nudge Texture Left
    - rid: 552786424166088823
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766076
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Textures mode, moves the selected surface's texture left by a classic pixel (a 128th of a world unit), or, with Snapping, to the next 32nd of a world unit. A transparent texture layered over a wall isn't nudged (adjust it in the inspector).
    - rid: 552786424166088824
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766077
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Nudge Texture Right
    - rid: 552786424166088825
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766078
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Textures mode, moves the selected surface's texture right by a classic pixel (a 128th of a world unit), or, with Snapping, to the next 32nd of a world unit. A transparent texture layered over a wall isn't nudged (adjust it in the inspector).
    - rid: 552786424166088826
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766079
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Align to Selection
    - rid: 552786424166088827
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766080
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Textures mode, hold while clicking a surface to align its texture to the selected surface of the same kind (a neighboring side, or any floor or ceiling). Its texture isn't changed.
    - rid: 552786424166088828
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766081
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Align Contiguous
    - rid: 552786424166088829
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766082
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Textures mode, hold while dragging or nudging a surface's texture to align the contiguous surfaces with the same bitmap to it. It can be pressed or let go mid-drag.
    - rid: 552786424166088830
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766083
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Target Transparent Layer
    - rid: 552786424166088831
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766084
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Textures mode, hold as you start dragging a wall that has a transparent texture over it to adjust that transparent texture, rather than the one behind it (letting go mid-drag doesn't switch back).
    - rid: 552786424166088832
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766085
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Toggle Selected Platform
    - rid: 552786424166088833
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766086
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Starts or stops the simulation of each platform that's selected (or that a selected polygon, line, side or object is part of), in any mode, whether or not a player could. Both halves of a split platform. Not while Ctrl or Command is held.
    - rid: 552786424166088834
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766087
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Obstruct Selected Platform
    - rid: 552786424166088835
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766088
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Simulates something in the way of each selected platform as it extends (both halves of a split platform), as its inspector's Obstruct Extension does.
    - rid: 552786424166088836
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766089
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Show/Hide UI
    - rid: 552786424166088837
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766090
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Shows or hides all of ForgePlus's panels, leaving only the level view.
    - rid: 552786424166088838
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766091
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Open/Close Menu
    - rid: 552786424166088839
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766092
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Opens or closes this menu (and shows the UI, if it was hidden).
    - rid: 552786424166088840
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766093
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Undo
    - rid: 552786424166088841
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766094
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Undoes the last edit or selection change.
    - rid: 552786424166088842
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766095
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Redo
    - rid: 552786424166088843
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5038888711766096
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Redoes what was last undone.
    - rid: 552786424166088846
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5041631518146560
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Command
    - rid: 552786424166088847
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5045579306123264
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Conflicts (both act at once):'
    - rid: 552786424166088848
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5045579310317568
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: "\u2022 {0} overlaps {1} ({2}), bound to {3}"
    - rid: 552786424166088849
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685126860800
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Use Platform
    - rid: 552786424166088850
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685131055104
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Uses the platform in front of the camera as a player''s action key would, in any mode: it must be a door a player can use (or one that plays its uncontrollable sound), and within reach. It starts the platform if it''s off; if it''s on, it reverses or restarts it as the platform allows. Not in the top-down view, or while Ctrl or Command is held.'
    - rid: 552786424166088852
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685131055106
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Delete Selected
    - rid: 552786424166088853
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685131055107
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Deletes or clears what''s selected, as the mode has it. Geometry: deletes the selected polygons (leaving their lines and points, empty, and deleting what was in them), points (taking each out of its chain of lines, and deleting polygons left with fewer than three corners) and lines (by deleting the points at both their ends); points left with no lines are removed. Objects and Annotations: deletes the selected ones. Sounds: clears the selected polygons'' ambient and random sounds. Media: clears the media of the polygon it was selected in. Lights: sets the face it was selected on to light 0. Platforms: makes the selected platforms normal polygons. Textures: clears the textures of the selected surfaces (the face clicked, and the same face of the rest of the selection).'
    - rid: 552786424166088854
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685131055108
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Display
    - rid: 552786424166088855
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685131055109
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Rendering
    - rid: 552786424166088856
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685131055110
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Units
    - rid: 552786424166088857
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685131055111
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Editing
    - rid: 552786424166088858
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685131055112
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Top-Down View
    - rid: 552786424166088859
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685131055113
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Saving
    - rid: 552786424166088860
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685131055114
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: UI Scale
    - rid: 552786424166088861
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685131055115
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How large the UI is drawn, from 100% to 350% (as Windows scales the display), for high-resolution screens. Applied once you let go of the slider.
    - rid: 552786424166088862
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5056685131055116
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0}%'
    - rid: 552786457188368443
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5435900359753728
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: New Map
    - rid: 552786457188368444
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5435900372336640
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Creates a new map file: choose where to save it, then name its first level (a map file must have at least one level), which is set up for single player as New Level''s are. It''s saved right away, then loaded with its level open, in place of the loaded map file (if the open level has unsaved edits, you''re asked first whether to save or discard them). It''s saved as Marathon 2 data, which the original games can read.'
    - rid: 552786457188368445
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5435900372336641
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: New Level
    - rid: 552786457188368446
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5435900372336642
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'Adds a new level to the end of the loaded map file, named in a dialog, and selects it (ready to load). It''s set up for single player, as Forge and Weland start one: a starting room with a player start, the single player entry point, and lights from full intensity down to none in steps of 5%. The map file is saved right away, with its other levels as they were last saved (so the open level''s unsaved edits stay unsaved), and its checksum changes. Grayed out while no map file is loaded.'
    - rid: 552786457188368447
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5435900372336643
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Create a New Map File
    - rid: 552786457188368448
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5435900372336644
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: New Map
    - rid: 552786457188368449
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5435900372336645
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Light Multiplier
    - rid: 552786457188368450
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5435900372336646
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How much light surfaces give Surface Cache Global Illumination to bounce onto other surfaces, from none (0x) to ten times their own (10x). Only while Surface Cache Global Illumination is on.
    - rid: 552786457188368451
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 5435900372336647
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0:0.0}x'
    - rid: 552786629739413553
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299904
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Play Mode
    - rid: 552786629739413554
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299905
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Move Forward
    - rid: 552786629739413555
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299906
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Play mode, moves the player forward while held.
    - rid: 552786629739413556
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299907
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Move Back
    - rid: 552786629739413557
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299908
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Play mode, moves the player back while held.
    - rid: 552786629739413558
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299909
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Sidestep Left
    - rid: 552786629739413559
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299910
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Play mode, moves the player to its left while held.
    - rid: 552786629739413560
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299911
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Sidestep Right
    - rid: 552786629739413561
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299912
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Play mode, moves the player to its right while held.
    - rid: 552786629739413562
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299913
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Walk
    - rid: 552786629739413563
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299914
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Play mode, the player walks rather than runs while held.
    - rid: 552786629739413564
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299915
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Action
    - rid: 552786629739413565
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299916
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Play mode, uses the door, platform, switch or terminal in front of the player and within its reach, as the game's action key does.
    - rid: 552786629739413566
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299917
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Swim
    - rid: 552786629739413567
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299918
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Play mode, swims up while held with the player's head under a liquid.
    - rid: 552786629739413568
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299919
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Next Page
    - rid: 552786629739413569
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299920
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Reading a terminal in Play mode, goes on to its next page, or out of the terminal after its last.
    - rid: 552786629739413570
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299921
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Previous Page
    - rid: 552786629739413571
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299922
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Reading a terminal in Play mode, goes back to its previous page.
    - rid: 552786629739413572
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299923
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Exit
    - rid: 552786629739413573
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 8140898210299924
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: In Play mode, leaves the terminal being read, or else Play mode itself.
    - rid: 552786749222813696
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 10052098120630272
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Media Fog
    - rid: 552786749222813697
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 10052098120630273
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Color ({0})
    - rid: 552786749222813698
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 10052098120630274
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The color of the fog under this type of media (Media Fog, in More Display Options), as hexadecimal (#RRGGBB). It's lit by each polygon's media light. It starts as the tint Aleph One gives the view from under this type of media.
    - rid: 552786749222813699
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 10052098120630275
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Density ({0})
    - rid: 552786749222813700
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 10052098120630276
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: 'How thick the fog under this type of media is (Media Fog, in More Display Options), per world unit seen through: the farther through it, the more of the fog''s color covers what''s behind (exponentially). None draws no fog. It starts at Aleph One''s below-liquid fog density, an eighth (a fog depth of 8 world units).'
    - rid: 552786749222813701
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 10052098120630277
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: '{0:0.000}'
